  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Pat firm tofu dry (see ingredients) and cut into 1cm pieces. Grate carrot.\n• In a medium bowl, combine the plain flour, tofu and a generous pinch of salt and pepper.\n• In a large bowl, combine mayonnaise, 1/2 the rice wine vinegar and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• In a small bowl, combine sweet chilli sauce, ginger paste, soy sauce, sesame seeds and remaining rice wine vinegar.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6308267c0bf01a0ab2004a07/step-05b9074d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, shake excess flour off tofu and cook in batches, turning occasionally, until golden, 5-7 mins. Transfer to bowl.\n• Remove from heat. Stir in sweet chilli glaze mixture, gently tossing to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6308267c0bf01a0ab2004a07/step-24d92d67.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To bowl with mayo dressing, add carrot, shredded cabbage mix and crushed peanuts. Toss to combine. Season.\n• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a plate for 10 seconds bursts until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6308267c0bf01a0ab2004a07/step-611c25d5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Build tacos by filling tortillas with peanut slaw and crispy sweet chilli tofu.\n• Tear over coriander.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6308267c0bf01a0ab2004a07/step-1afe1dc9.jpg"
    }
  ]
